<title>USA: BFX Hospitality Group name change effective.</title>
<headline>BFX Hospitality Group name change effective.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buffton Corp said Thursday that its name change to BFX Hospitality Group Inc has become effective as of July 8.</p>
<p>The company is now trading on the American Stock Exchange under the symbol BFX. The company said it has been informed that the name change will be effective for trading purposes on the American Stock Exchange as of Monday, July 21.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
